## Notes

- No Flipper Zero, Momentum, or u8g2 source code is copied into this
  repository. The display driver is an independent implementation of the
  ST7567 command set and of u8g2's public callback API.
- "Flipper Zero" and "Momentum" are used descriptively; this project is not
  affiliated with or endorsed by Flipper Devices or the Momentum maintainers.
- Do not use this project to transmit on frequencies or in ways that are
  illegal in your jurisdiction. The default configuration is receive-only.
